  DUT     : swi_d (AT-x960-56YSQ) console u2 @115200, S/N A2WQS700B, standalone,
            sin_x96056-20261012-24. SVI MAC e0:1a:ea:d4:70:43 -- `show interface
            vlan10` and `show interface vlan48` BOTH report "Hardware is VLAN, address
            is e01a.ead4.7043", so every SVI on this unit shares one MAC.
  link    : tb277 eth3 <-> swi_d port1.0.10  (copper, untagged VLAN 10)
  link    : tb277 eth4 <-> swi_d port1.0.48  (copper, untagged VLAN 48)
  host    : tb277 eth3 00:0d:b9:55:77:0e -> swi_d port1.0.10 (frame source)
